  "description": "Drop-in helpers to address common pain points when working with System.Text.Json in .NET applications. Provides Newtonsoft.Json-like conveniences including deep merge, JSON patch, polymorphic deserialization, flexible enums, optional property defaults, case-insensitive matching, JsonPath queries, LINQ-to-JSON, and comprehensive validation - all while maintaining System.Text.Json's performance benefits.",
  "id": "JsonToolkit.STJ",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-12-27T04:06:40.86Z",
